host-guardian (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Mount identity verification against /proc/self/mountinfo.
  * Named-unit shedding under memory emergency, with per-unit cooldown and a
    global action budget.
  * Resident daemon driven by a PSI trigger, with systemd watchdog supervision.

